[ceiling] These are the closing ends of the vent and drain-sleeve clearance windows. The long sleeve window ends at Z309.4 and spans the complete threaded-joint adjustment. Tree(auto)/Default supports the ends through their open lower channel; the small flathead reaches them before hardware installation.
alternatives: Filling or shortening the windows enters the measured vent/sleeve volume at a permitted thread position. Ramping within the clearance removes that axial adjustment. The roof height supplies solid backing below the fitted adapter pocket.
