[sliver] This 0.676 mm-wide face is one of the adapter pocket's specified conforming hex flats, over the complete 10.25 mm hex band. The flat's direction and the 12.874 mm rounded-corner boundary define the selected fitted section. Derek explicitly retains the conforming hex and ensures its clock when assembling the taped joint.
alternatives: Removing this plane changes the selected hex fit. Removing the corner boundary opens its rounded-corner envelope; replacing the flat with a circular room removes the hex conformity Derek requests. Adding exterior material does not widen this interior mating face.
